      "fact": "Source flavour group SU3_Q x SU3_U x SU3_D, optionally U3_U x U3_D: QL fundamentalQ, UR/Psiu fundamentalU, DR/Psid fundamentalD, PsiuR/PsidR fundamentalQ. All quarks colour3; RH labels convert by conjugating BOTH colour and every flavour factor. Yu=(bar3Q,3U,1),Yd=(bar3Q,1,3D) complex scalars. Each flavour triplet is one gauge multiplet, NOT three additional copies."
    },
