      "fact": "Section2 gives the two-flavon minimal field table, including all colored fields; p5 introduces SM leptons; section2.2 distinguishes optional extra flavons and gauged lepton sectors from this minimal model. Section5.2 specifies fundamental-number U(1)_UR and U(1)_DR generators. Scalar-potential phenomenological limitations do not change the explicitly two-flavon gauge-matter inventory. Each flavour triplet is one gauge multiplet, not three copies. RH fermions are conjugated on all colour/flavour/U1 slots."
